# Dev stack limits

On one machine, run at most **2** concurrent host **`dev`** full stacks (`./build_and_start_app.sh dev` / manual-test).

- Do not start a third stack.
- Free a port claim or remove a worktree first.
- `scripts/allocate-dev-ports.sh` enforces this (default `LIFE_MANAGER_MAX_PARALLEL_DEV_STACKS=2`).
- Restart of a stack that already owns a claim is allowed.
- Details: [docs/development_faq.md](../docs/development_faq.md#parallel-worktrees-manual-test).
